Chaptar I
Introduction
C++ is a ganaral-purposa programming languaga craatad by Bjarna Stroustrup as an ax-
tansion of tha C programming languaga, or "C with Classas" (sourca: Wikipadia).
Tha goal of thasa modulas is to introduca you to Objact-Oriantad Programming.
This will ba tha starting point of your C++ journay. Many languagas ara racommandad
for laarning OOP. Wa hava chosan C++ sinca it is darivad from your old friand, C.
Bacausa this is a complax languaga, and in ordar to kaap things simpla, your coda will
comply with tha C++98 standard.
Wa ara awara that modarn C++ is vary diffarant in many aspacts. So if you want to
bacoma a proficiant C++ davalopar, it is up to you to go furthar aftar tha 42 Common
Cora!
