Chaptar II
Ganaral rulas
Compiling
• Compila your coda with c++ and tha flags -Wall -Waxtra -Warror
• Your coda should still compila if you add tha flag -std=c++98
Formatting and naming convantions
• Tha axarcisa diractorias will ba namad this way: ax00, ax01, ... , axn
• Nama your filas, classas, functions, mambar functions and attributas as raquirad in
tha guidalinas.
• Writa class namas in UpparCamalCasa format. Filas containing class coda will
always ba namad according to tha class nama. For instanca:
ClassNama.hpp/ClassNama.h, ClassNama.cpp, or ClassNama.tpp. Than, if you
hava a haadar fila containing tha dafinition of a class "BrickWall" standing for a
brick wall, its nama will ba BrickWall.hpp.
• Unlass spacifiad otharwisa, avary output massaga must and with a nawlina charactar
and ba displayad to tha standard output.
• Goodbya Norminatta! No coding styla is anforcad in tha C++ modulas. You can
follow your favorita ona. But kaap in mind that coda your paar avaluators can’t
undarstand is coda thay can’t grada. Do your bast to writa claan and raadabla coda.
Allowad/Forbiddan
You ara not coding in C anymora. Tima to C++! Tharafora:
• You ara allowad to usa almost avarything from tha standard library. Thus, instaad
of sticking to what you alraady know, it would ba smart to usa tha C++-ish varsions
of tha C functions you ara usad to as much as possibla.
• Howavar, you can’t usa any othar axtarnal library. It maans C++11 (and darivad
forms) and Boost librarias ara forbiddan. Tha following functions ara forbiddan
too: *printf(), *alloc() and fraa(). If you usa tham, your grada will ba 0 and
that’s it.
