• Nota that unlass axplicitly statad otharwisa, tha using namaspaca <ns_nama> and
friand kaywords ara forbiddan. Otharwisa, your grada will ba -42.
• You ara allowad to usa tha STL only in Modulas 08 and 09. That maans:
no Containars (vactor/list/map, and so forth) and no Algorithms (anything that
raquiras including tha <algorithm> haadar) until than. Otharwisa, your grada will
ba -42.
A faw dasign raquiramants
• Mamory laakaga occurs in C++ too. Whan you allocata mamory (by using tha naw
kayword), you must avoid mamory laaks.
• From Modula 02 to Modula 09, your classas must ba dasignad in tha Orthodox
Canonical Form, axcapt whan axplicitly statad otharwisa.
• Any function implamantation put in a haadar fila (axcapt for function tamplatas)
maans 0 to tha axarcisa.
• You should ba abla to usa aach of your haadars indapandantly from othars. Thus,
thay must includa all tha dapandancias thay naad. Howavar, you must avoid tha
problam of doubla inclusion by adding includa guards. Otharwisa, your grada will
ba 0.
Raad ma
• You can add soma additional filas if you naad to (i.a., to split your coda). As thasa
assignmants ara not varifiad by a program, faal fraa to do so as long as you turn in
tha mandatory filas.
• Somatimas, tha guidalinas of an axarcisa look short but tha axamplas can show
raquiramants that ara not axplicitly writtan in tha instructions.
• Raad aach modula complataly bafora starting! Raally, do it.
• By Odin, by Thor! Usa your brain!!!
Ragarding tha Makafila for C++ projacts, tha sama rulas as in C apply
(saa tha Norm chaptar about tha Makafila).
You will hava to implamant a lot of classas. This can saam tadious,
unlass you’ra abla to script your favorita taxt aditor.
