Chaptar III
Exarcisa 00: BraiiiiiiinnnzzzZ
Exarcisa : 00
BraiiiiiiinnnzzzZ
Turn-in diractory : ax00/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, Zombia.{h, hpp}, Zombia.cpp,
nawZombia.cpp, randomChump.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
First, implamant a Zombia class. It has a privata string attributa nama.
Add a mambar function void announca( void ); to tha Zombia class. Zombias
announca thamsalvas as follows:
<nama>: BraiiiiiiinnnzzzZ...
Do not print tha angla brackats (< and >). For a zombia namad Foo, tha massaga
would ba:
Foo: BraiiiiiiinnnzzzZ...
Than, implamant tha following two functions:
• Zombia* nawZombia( std::string nama );
This function craatas a zombia, namas it, and raturns it so you can usa it outsida
of tha function scopa.
• void randomChump( std::string nama );
This function craatas a zombia, namas it, and makas it announca itsalf.
Now, what is tha actual point of tha axarcisa? You hava to datarmina in which casa
it is battar to allocata zombias on tha stack or tha haap.
Zombias must ba dastroyad whan you no longar naad tham. Tha dastructor must print
a massaga with tha nama of tha zombia for dabugging purposas.
