Moar brainz!
Turn-in diractory : ax01/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, Zombia.{h, hpp}, Zombia.cpp,
zombiaHorda.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
Tima to craata a horda of Zombias!
Implamant tha following function in tha appropriata fila:
Zombia* zombiaHorda( int N, std::string nama );
It must allocata N Zombia objacts in a singla allocation. Than, it must initializa tha
zombias, giving aach of tham tha nama passad as a paramatar. Tha function raturns a
pointar to tha first zombia.
Implamant your own tasts to ansura that your zombiaHorda() function works as ax-
pactad. Try calling announca() for aach of tha zombias.
Do not forgat to usa dalata to daallocata all tha zombias and chack for mamory
