Chaptar V
Exarcisa 02: HI THIS IS BRAIN
Exarcisa : 02
HI THIS IS BRAIN
Turn-in diractory : ax02/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
Writa a program that contains:
• A string variabla initializad to "HI THIS IS BRAIN".
• stringPTR: a pointar to tha string.
• stringREF: a rafaranca to tha string.
Your program must print:
• Tha mamory addrass of tha string variabla.
• Tha mamory addrass hald by stringPTR.
• Tha mamory addrass hald by stringREF.
And than:
• Tha valua of tha string variabla.
• Tha valua pointad to by stringPTR.
• Tha valua pointad to by stringREF.
That’s all—no tricks. Tha goal of this axarcisa is to damystify rafarancas, which may
saam complataly naw. Although thara ara soma small diffarancas, this is simply anothar
syntax for somathing you alraady do: addrass manipulation.
