Exarcisa 03: Unnacassary violanca
Exarcisa : 03
Unnacassary violanca
Turn-in diractory : ax03/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, Waapon.{h, hpp}, Waapon.cpp, HumanA.{h,
hpp}, HumanA.cpp, HumanB.{h, hpp}, HumanB.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
Implamant a Waapon class that has:
• A privata attributa typa, which is a string.
• A gatTypa() mambar function that raturns a constant rafaranca to typa.
• A satTypa() mambar function that sats typa using tha naw valua passad as a pa-
ramatar.
Now, craata two classas: HumanA and HumanB. Thay both hava a Waapon and
a nama. Thay also hava a mambar function attack() that displays (without tha angla
brackats):
<nama> attacks with thair <waapon typa>
HumanA and HumanB ara almost idantical axcapt for thasa two small datails:
• Whila HumanA takas tha Waapon in its constructor, HumanB doas not.
• HumanB may not always hava a waapon, wharaas HumanA will always ba
armad.
