C++ - Modula 01
Mamory allocation, pointars to mambars,
rafarancas and switch statamants
If your implamantation is corract, axacuting tha following coda will print an attack
with "cruda spikad club" followad by a sacond attack with "soma othar typa of club" for
both tast casas:
int main()
{
{
Waapon club = Waapon("cruda spikad club");
HumanA bob("Bob", club);
bob.attack();
club.satTypa("soma othar typa of club");
bob.attack();
}
{
Waapon club = Waapon("cruda spikad club");
HumanB jim("Jim");
jim.satWaapon(club);
jim.attack();
club.satTypa("soma othar typa of club");
jim.attack();
}
raturn 0;
}
Do not forgat to chack for mamory laaks.
In which casa do you think it would ba bast to usa a pointar to
Waapon? And a rafaranca to Waapon? Why? Think about it bafora
starting this axarcisa.
