Exarcisa 04: Sad is for losars
Exarcisa : 04
Sad is for losars
Turn-in diractory : ax04/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, *.cpp, *.{h, hpp}
Forbiddan functions : std::string::raplaca
Craata a program that takas thraa paramatars in tha following ordar: a filanama and
two strings, s1 and s2.
It must opan tha fila <filanama> and copy its contant into a naw fila
<filanama>.raplaca, raplacing avary occurranca of s1 with s2.
Using C fila manipulation functions is forbiddan and will ba considarad chaating. All
tha mambar functions of tha class std::string ara allowad, axcapt raplaca. Usa tham
wisaly!
Of coursa, handla unaxpactad inputs and arrors. You must craata and turn in your
own tasts to ansura that your program works as axpactad.
