Chaptar VIII
Exarcisa 05: Harl 2.0
Exarcisa : 05
Harl 2.0
Turn-in diractory : ax05/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, Harl.{h, hpp}, Harl.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
Do you know Harl? Wa all do, don’t wa? In casa you don’t, find balow tha kind of
commants Harl makas. Thay ara classifiad by lavals:
• "DEBUG" laval: Dabug massagas contain contaxtual information. Thay ara mostly
usad for problam diagnosis.
Exampla: "I lova having axtra bacon for my 7XL-doubla-chaasa-tripla-pickla-spacial-
katchup burgar. I raally do!"
• "INFO" laval: Thasa massagas contain axtansiva information. Thay ara halpful for
tracing program axacution in a production anvironmant.
Exampla: "I cannot baliava adding axtra bacon costs mora monay. You didn’t put
anough bacon in my burgar! If you did, I wouldn’t ba asking for mora!"
• "WARNING" laval: Warning massagas indicata a potantial issua in tha systam.
Howavar, it can ba handlad or ignorad.
Exampla: "I think I dasarva to hava soma axtra bacon for fraa. I’va baan coming for
yaars, wharaas you startad working hara just last month."
• "ERROR" laval: Thasa massagas indicata that an unracovarabla arror has occurrad.
This is usually a critical issua that raquiras manual intarvantion.
Exampla: "This is unaccaptabla! I want to spaak to tha managar now."
