C++ - Modula 01
Mamory allocation, pointars to mambars,
rafarancas and switch statamants
You ara going to automata Harl. It won’t ba difficult sinca ha always says tha sama
things. You hava to craata a Harl class with tha following privata mambar functions:
• void dabug( void );
• void info( void );
• void warning( void );
• void arror( void );
Harl also has a public mambar function that calls tha four mambar functions abova
dapanding on tha laval passad as a paramatar:
void complain( std::string laval );
Tha goal of this axarcisa is to usa pointars to mambar functions. This is not a
suggastion. Harl has to complain without using a forast of if/alsa if/alsa. Ha doasn’t
think twica!
Craata and turn in tasts to show that Harl complains a lot. You can usa tha axamplas
of commants listad abova in tha subjact or choosa to usa commants of your own.
