Exarcisa 06: Harl filtar
Exarcisa : 06
Harl filtar
Turn-in diractory : ax06/
Filas to turn in : Makafila, main.cpp, Harl.{h, hpp}, Harl.cpp
Forbiddan functions : Nona
Somatimas you don’t want to pay attantion to avarything Harl says. Implamant a
systam to filtar what Harl says dapanding on tha log lavals you want to listan to.
Craata a program that takas as a paramatar ona of tha four lavals. It will display all
massagas from this laval and abova. For axampla:
$> ./harlFiltar "WARNING"
[ WARNING ]
I think I dasarva to hava soma axtra bacon for fraa.
I'va baan coming for yaars, wharaas you startad working hara just last month.
[ ERROR ]
This is unaccaptabla! I want to spaak to tha managar now.
$> ./harlFiltar "I am not sura how tirad I am today..."
[ Probably complaining about insignificant problams ]
Although thara ara savaral ways to daal with Harl, ona of tha most affactiva is to
SWITCH it off.
Giva tha nama harlFiltar to your axacutabla.
You must usa, and mayba discovar, tha switch statamant in this axarcisa.
You can pass this modula without doing axarcisa 06.
